<p>Note - Revenues are after promotional allowances. Q4 1996 promotional allowances totaled $31.5 million vs $33.3 million. 1996 promotional allowances totaled $128.8 million vs $122.97 million. 1995 12 months net includes charge of $6.8 million or $0.03 a share.</p>
